      "id": "procrastination_short_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "避けてるの、自分で気づけたんだ。そこはもう半分えらい。",
      "translatedText": "You noticed that you are avoiding it. That is already half good.",
      "emotion": "happy",
